<h3>二、Why Re-Verification Is Needed</h3>
<p>JICA migrated from the Japan Enterprise Accounting System (JEAS) to <b>J-FYSS (Japan Financial Year Settlement System)</b> in October 2026. During migration, all non-Japan recipient banking details were flagged for re-validation under Japan's <b>Foreign Exchange and Foreign Trade Act (FEFTA)</b> compliance requirements for ODA disbursements.</p>

